#v(1em)

Dear Paul,

I am applying for the SAP S/4HANA (Basis) Engineer - Sovereign Cloud Delivery Germany position. Contributing to a harmonized, secure Sovereign Cloud offering for regulated industries is exactly the kind of work I want to be part of.

I want to be upfront: hands-on S/4HANA Basis experience is not yet part of my background. What I bring instead is five rotations across SAP, including work with SAP Analytics Cloud, SAP Datasphere, and SAP CAP, which gave me a solid understanding of how SAP systems and landscapes fit together, along with comfort operating in Linux environments and troubleshooting production issues. As co-founder of NEXtickets, I have also operated a live product end-to-end, which taught me what disciplined operations, monitoring, and incident response actually require in practice.

I learn quickly when working on real systems, and I am motivated to build deep S/4HANA Basis expertise in a team that operates at this scale and level of responsibility.

I finish my dual studies at DHBW Mannheim in September 2026 and hold an unconditional hire recommendation from SAP. I am also open to the security clearance process this role requires.

#v(2em)

Best regards,

#v(0.5em)

*Max Meinel*
